OL,3,GNEWSAThird man charged over city
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third man has been charged after
OL,7,Ftrouble flared in Digbeth and a man was
OL,8,Fshot in the leg.
OL,10,FEwan Patterson, 27, has been charged
OL,11,Fwith attempted murder, possession of a
OL,12,Ffirearm and violent disorder after the
OL,13,Fincident last Sunday night, West
OL,14,FMidlands Police said.
OL,16,FKeon Knowles was taken to hospital with
OL,17,Fa gunshot injury after trouble inside
OL,18,Fthe Luna Springs venue spilled out onto
OL,19,FHack Street and Bromley Street.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
