OL,3,GNEWSAThird man charged over city
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 23-year-old has been possession of
OL,7,Fa firearm with intent to endanger life
OL,8,Fand violent disorder. Rowan Youngsam,
OL,9,F20, is charged with possession of a
OL,10,Ffirearm with intent to endanger life,
OL,11,Fand wounding with intent. Patterson is
OL,12,Fdue before magistrates in the city on
OL,13,FMonday, police said.
